    "body": "The shop-breaking cause was the old child-vulnerability predicate hooks. The current RDR2 process started after the zero-hook build was installed: its live log says hooks=0 writes=0, and I read the two former hook targets directly from this running process; both contain their original Rockstar prologues, with no MinHook jump left. You can test any shopkeeper, station clerk, or paperboy in the game that is open now—no restart is needed for this check. If interactions are still absent in this clean process, the log will distinguish that from the removed hook cause.",
